We welcome all women - cis, trans, and nonbinary - who identify with women`s communities. Each Monday of the month, our group focuses on a different topic.

1st Monday- We look at the Laundry List and its Flip Side

2nd Monday- We discuss the ACA Bill of Rights;

3rd Monday- We look at the Other Laundry List and its Flip Side;

4th Monday- We look at the 12 Promises of ACA because they come true!

5th Monday- We look at the Workplace Laundry List

